# Firebase / push credentials
# The service-account JSON is a real secret: it can send push to every user of
# the project. google-services.json / GoogleService-Info.plist are not secrets,
# but they are per-project so they stay out of the repo too.
**/wanes-firebase-service-account*.json
**/wanees-notification*.json
**/firebase-service-account*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/serviceAccountKey*.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Local scratch used while poking the API by hand (admin JWT, request payloads)
/.tok
/cfg.json

# Per-user Visual Studio publish state
*.pubxml.user

# uploaded driver documents (local file storage)
App_Data/
